<title>USA: Maxim Group completes Image merger.</title>
<headline>Maxim Group completes Image merger.</headline>
<dateline>KENNESAW, Ga. 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maxim Group Inc said it completed its $91.5 million merger with Image Industries Inc, a plastic recycler and carpet manufacturer.</p>
<p>Under terms of the deal, Image shareholders will receive one share of Maxim common stock for each share of Image common stock, the company said.</p>
<p>Maxim, a floor-covering retailer, operates about 700 locations in the United States and Canada.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
